  GraduationCap, Home, LayoutGrid, Lightbulb, LoaderCircle, Menu, MessageCircle, Moon, MoreHorizontal,
  Palette, Play, Plus, RotateCcw, Search, Send, Settings, Share2, ShieldCheck, Sparkles, Star,
